SUMMARY:Schomberg Horticultural Society – Kristen Martyn Backyard Birds
DESCRIPTION:“20 Things You Didn’t Know About Backyard Birds” by Kristen Martyn. Kristen is a Birder and Naturalist whose passion for wildlife led her to pursue a Bachelor of Science Degree in Zoology as well as a post-graduate program in Ecotourism and Adventure Tourism Management.  Kristen is an avid birdwatcher\, who has birded all over North America\, the Caribbean\, Central and South America\, Australia and Southern Africa. She has spent countless hours leading birding tours\, birding in the field and taking birding trips. It will be a delight to get her insights into the birds we see in our own yards.   https://kristenmartyn.com/ \nDoors open at 7pm  – presentation starts at 7:30pm \nFree to members\, $ 5.00 at the door for guests – refreshments\, flower show\, door prizes \n 
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/schomberg-horticultural-society-kristen-martyn-backyard-birds/
LOCATION:Schomberg CommunityHall\, 325 Main Street\, Schomberg\, L0G1T0
CATEGORIES:Community Event,District,Flower & Vegetable Show,Grow With Us!,Guest Speaker,Society Meeting,Workshops
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gardenontario.org/wp-content/uploads/Kristen-Martyn-april-2026.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Schomberg Horticultural Society":MAILTO:schomberghortsociety@gmail.com
GEO:44.0039021;-79.6844574
