SUMMARY:Niagara Falls Horticultural Society Spring Planter Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our 2nd Annual Spring Planter Workshop  & unleash your creativity! Craft a stunning spring planter with daffodils\, tulips\, hyacinths\, pansies\, branches\, and other hardy plants. Whether you’re experienced or a beginner\, our workshop will guide you in creating a planter that reflects your style. Don’t miss this chance to learn and bring spring’s beauty to your home.\n\nSign up today! Price: $50 includes all materials & light refreshments. Limited spots available. Proceeds to benefit St. John’s Anglican Church.\n\n 2nd Annual Spring Planter Workshop Saturday\, May 2\, 2026 12:00pm – 2:00pm St. John’s Anglican Church Hall\, 3428 Portage Road\, Niagara Falls\, ON\n\nFor more information or to register please email: niagarafallshortsoc@gmail.com\n\nsocials: @niagarafallshortwebsite: niagarafallshort.org
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/niagara-falls-horticultural-society-spring-planter-workshop/
LOCATION:St. John’s Anglican Church Hall\, 3428 Portage Road\, Niagara Falls\, ON\, 3428 Portage Road\, Niagara Falls\, L2J 2K4\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Workshops
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://gardenontario.org/wp-content/uploads/2026-SPRING-PLANTER-WORKSHOP.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Niagara Falls Horticultural Society":MAILTO:shannonmichelleb@live.com
GEO:43.1235805;-79.099177
